WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.868
Watch it, read along, or just listen. Your words keep up.

2
00:00:07.168 --> 00:00:10.447
Watching? Swipe up, and the lines follow under the video.

3
00:00:11.747 --> 00:00:15.529
Reading? Press play on the page, and the line you're on turns bold.

4
00:00:16.829 --> 00:00:20.954
Just listening? Turn on Keep listening when locked, and take it on a walk.

5
00:00:22.254 --> 00:00:27.124
The lock screen only says Tell Anew. Never a title, never your words.

6
00:00:28.424 --> 00:00:32.520
Want a name spelled your way? Hold the line, and tap Fix the words.

7
00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:38.033
The fix stays at the right second, so the captions and search have it too.

8
00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:43.496
Open any entry. Press play, or hold a line.
